    <title>Go 汇编反汇编</title>
    <link>https://hotttao.github.io/posts/program/go/expert/go_export/expert_13/</link>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jan 2023 22:00:00 &#43;0800</pubDate>
    <author>作者</author>
    <guid>https://hotttao.github.io/posts/program/go/expert/go_export/expert_13/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2 id="1-查看go程序的汇编代码">1. 查看Go程序的汇编代码</h2>
<p>查看Go程序的汇编代码有多种方法：</p>
<ol>
<li>使用objdump工具：<code>objdump -S go二进制文件</code></li>
<li>使用gdb disassemble</li>
<li>使用go tool工具生成汇编代码文件：<code>go build -gcflags '-S' xx.go &gt; xx.s 2&gt;&amp;1</code></li>
<li>将Go代码编译成汇编代码：<code>go tool compile -S xx.go &gt; xx.s</code></li>
<li>使用go tool工具反编译Go程序：<code>go tool objdump -S go-binary &gt; xx.s</code></li>
</ol>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-go" data-lang="go"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// 编译</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">GOARCH</span><span class="p">=</span><span class="mi">386</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">go</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">tool</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">compile</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nx">N</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nx">l</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">test</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="k">go</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1">// 反编译</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nx">GOARCH</span><span class="p">=</span><span class="mi">386</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">go</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">tool</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">objdump</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nx">gnu</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">test</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">o</span><span class="w">
